          "summary": "Narrow one-way 24-month no-hire to a mutual 12-month non-solicit limited to personnel involved in the Services, with general-advertising and unsolicited-approach carve-outs.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot accept a one-way, 24-month bar on hiring or employing any Vendor employee, including those who apply on their own initiative; our playbook permits at most a mutual non-solicit limited to personnel directly involved in the Services, running 12 months from the end of that involvement, with carve-outs for general advertisements and unsolicited approaches and no no-hire element. This also removes the conflict with § 12.3, in which Vendor acknowledges we have made no no-hire commitment.",
