              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0045",
              "oldText": "12.4 Customer shall not solicit, hire, or employ any Vendor employee during the term or for twenty-four months afterward, regardless of how the employee applies.",
              "newText": "12.4 During the term and for twelve months after the end of an individual's involvement in the Services, neither party shall knowingly solicit for employment any employee of the other party who was directly involved in performing or receiving the Services. This restriction does not apply to general advertisements or other recruitment activity not specifically targeted at the other party's personnel, or to unsolicited approaches by an individual, and neither party is restricted from hiring or engaging any person who responds to such advertisements or makes such an approach."
